{"parse": {"title": "AFF-20", "pageid": 123516, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-19\" title=\"AFF-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-20</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B9.B3.E5.87.A1.E7.9A.84.E6.97.A5.E5.AD.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"平凡的日子\">平凡的日子</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 平凡的日子</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">In Ordinary Times</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>分<span class=\"color-value\"></span>享<span class=\"color-value\"></span>秘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>密<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>始<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210120</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>让我确认一下，也就是说……第五次“暴雨”是重塑之手导致的灾难。你就是他们罪行的证人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>但贝丽尔·布翁尼与重塑之手没有任何关系。<br />她是救了你的恩人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑镜中雾气退去，露出了受审者清晰的模样——她所言非虚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>之后发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我按布翁尼女士说的，来到了能够躲避那场“暴雨”的避难所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>路上雨越下越大，但幸好我们及时赶到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>只是我那辆小车里来不及、也没办法装下更多人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……现在远方仍有一座巴黎城，但那里已经不是我的故乡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我珍视的一切都被命运的洪流吞没……哈，就和那个预言一模一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用一声轻笑为这场讲述画上了句号，小房间内安静了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>接下来的事情你们已经都知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>多亏布翁尼女士的帮助，我才没有流落街头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>那些我曾熟悉的街道和人都变了，但幸好我的车还在身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>比起呆在安全的住处里悠哉度日，我还是更喜欢上街兜兜风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>布翁尼女士因为工作关系，常需要到处跑，我在那之后就一直跟在她边上帮忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>前段时间我还和她一起去了一趟德里，帮她卖掉手里的黄水晶……对了，我还在那里认识了她的女儿玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>她们母女的性格真是完全两样，玛蒂尔达小姐把什么都写在脸上。必须说，我和她更合得来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>不过布翁尼女士和我刚认识她那时候相比，也有了不小的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说到这里，她顿了顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我觉得……她变得更像是个活人了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谈话又持续了一段时间才宣告结束。待节奏匀整的脚步声远去，房间内归于寂静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>……看来贝丽尔·布翁尼没有问题，至少她亲自带回来的这位幸存者一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>她这几年一直跟在布翁尼的身边，如果布翁尼有什么可疑的地方，不太可能瞒得过她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>这可不好说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>声音来自房间中被阴影笼罩的角落，整场问询中，他的这位上司都始终保持着沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>你不相信测谎仪的结果？这可是最新的仪器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-631420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>机器总会出错，我更相信自己的直觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>执夜人从阴影中走出，来到方桌旁，伸手敲了敲桌面上那台价格不菲的“最新仪器”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>她一定有所隐瞒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>关于第五次“暴雨”中发生的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>也包括如今布翁尼忽然旧事重提的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>第九次“暴雨”后，她毫无征兆地失踪，谁也找不到她的下落……可谁能想到呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>她居然就这样若无其事地回来了——带着一条“不得了的消息”。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空洞的走廊里徒立着一个人，本该一片寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">耳畔的声音：</div><div>太蹩脚了，你犯了不止一个错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">耳畔的声音：</div><div>你简直就要把“我在说谎”写在脸上了。要不是我，你早就被抓包了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝本不打算理会，但那个声音喋喋不休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……你是要我感谢你吗，费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>别以为我不知道，你只是不想自己的事暴露给基金会而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>不要在圣洛夫基金会的设施里和我说话，谁能保证没有人在监视我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-640914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你不把话说出口我也能够听到，就像现在这样。<br />这是什么很难的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>万一我下意识地露出破绽了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>毕竟我不像你，压根就没有嘴了，所以没有这个烦恼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左手处传来一声冷哼，沿着骨骼攀至脑中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我发现你对我越来越无礼了，但对那个女人倒是乖顺得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我告诉过你，和我一起去面见引导之人才是你最好的归宿——你不听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>如果你选择投靠基金会也就罢了。最多是见识浅薄，看不清局势，犯了和所有乌合之众一样的错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>——可你偏偏把所有注都下在那个女人的身上！<br />真是个疯子，你就那么相信她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脑海中的怒骂未能激起预想中的激烈辩驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……我相信贝丽尔女士，因为她是我最好的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>她的判断是对的，时机到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房门被敲响。间隔几秒后，门内传来幕僚长的回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-501210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-501210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-501210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>哪位？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是我，维尔汀。我想询问外勤申请的审批进度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>能耽误您一些时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>往常这扇门总是会第一时间为她打开，但这次她却等待得稍久了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>请进，维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>推门而入，来宾用的革质沙发上正坐着一个陌生的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我们终于见面了，维尔汀。玛蒂尔达常提起你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同窗的名字唤起了记忆，面前女子精致的五官与另一张更加生气勃勃的面孔重叠在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您是……贝丽尔·布翁尼女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>看来我们能省去自我介绍环节了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的笑容柔和而亲切，眼里却没有带上同样的笑意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你也曾见过金色的纺线，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_62.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_62\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_62\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-3_2_at_62.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_62.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"390\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-3_2_at_62.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_62.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-3_2_at_62.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_62.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1684\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><span style=\"color:#403D50\">迁    流    的    盛    宴 <br /><i><span style=\"font-size:150%\">A  F l o w i n g  F e a s t</span></i></span><br /></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-20"}}